shards (hosted-artifact, true, true, false)	Verify the independent shard	2026-11-08T18:41:20.8792477Z     "support": "Every report gets a clear decision. Your team sees what's now, what's next, and why.",
shards (hosted-artifact, true, true, false)	Verify the independent shard	2026-11-08T18:41:20.8804422Z     "narrative": "Know what happens next.Every report gets a clear decision. Your team sees what's now, what's next, and why.100% free, open source alternative to Linear, Jira and AsanaRun VectorTry the demoRead the docsEvery issue says why it's there.Current is the one list your whole team shares. Each issue in it sits in exactly one section, ordered by priority and then due date. No hidden score.1Needs decision. Reports waiting for someone to make the call.2Now. Work that has started, or is past its due date.3Next. Committed to this cycle or the next, or due within 7 days.4Recently done. Finished in the last 7 days.Not just clearer. Free.Vector is 100% free and open source. Everything on this page is in the code you get. It's MIT licensed, so it's yours to use, change and run however you like.No seats.No plans.No fees.Run VectorLater gets a date.Not ready to decide? Defer it to a date and time. It comes back to Needs decision then, with a note in your Inbox, or sooner if new evidence arrives.The rest of your trackerMy work, Issues, a Board, Projects, Cycles, saved views, Search and an Inbox are all in the same free code.ProjectsHealth with a reason: the exact issue putting a project at risk.CyclesWhen a cycle ends, unfinished work rolls into the next one.HistoryEvery change and decision is kept, with who made it and when.SearchPress ⌘K and jump to any issue by its identifier or its words.Try it without switching.Run it on your computer next to the tracker you use today. It changes nothing there.1Run three commands. Open the link it prints and you're signed in.2Connect a source. Reports from your monitoring or support tool land in Needs decision.3Invite your team. Everyone sees the same list of what's now and next.Read the installation guideEvery report, decided.Run VectorRead the docs100% free and open source.",
